    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "AIで書類の値を照合するとき、どのように精度を評価しますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-02.mp3",
      "audioHash": "9fc818ade1ab0d3dd5b7285859a4253098d7646e271799f2cc20b6da4ee280c2",
